From: FunnyAWM <1142978300@qq.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 16:20:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(desktop): drive Bot Mode with a single default bot

The mobile client has one assistant, one conversation and a user-set
name. Mirror that here: the roster keeps only the default profile, the
toolbar loses create/group/filter controls, and a row offers open-chat
and rename only. Other profiles keep running; they are just not offered
in the Bots pane.
